&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-184978-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. I should mention here that the best way to content me is through Discord, I go there by Kein#5142.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-184978-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Yes, you’ve heard me right - summing.&lt;/div&gt;
