tion as to what this is, see the &quot;Cool Stuff!&quot; part of the page.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-253115-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. And will most likely by the dumbest I ever will.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-253115-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. Which failed miserably.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-253115-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. I should mention here that the best way to content me is through Discord, I go there by Kein#5142.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-253115-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. Yes, you’ve heard me right - summing.</div> </div> 
