ote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> MTF Omega-12 (&quot;Achilles Heels&quot;)<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> MTF Omega-12 (&quot;Achilles Heels&quot;)<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608647164" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunny-art-tales">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunny-art-tales</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> MTF Stigma-9 (&quot;Evolved from Naturally Occurring Gears, Levers and Pulleys&quot;)<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> MTF Stigma-9 (&quot;Evolved from Naturally Occurring Gears, Levers and Pulleys&quot;)<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608647164" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunny-art-tales">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunny-art-tales</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhov